["<aside class=\"callout why\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Memory lies by Christmas. A journal turns ten trips into one lesson you can use next year.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 333\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The journal lives only on your phone. Tap Export CSV, get a .csv file, open it in any spreadsheet. Export after each trip and save it off the phone, because a lost phone loses your seasons.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"333\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Back it up: Export CSV</text>\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"48\" width=\"78\" height=\"138\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#23261f\"/><rect x=\"27\" y=\"60\" width=\"64\" height=\"104\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#dde8f2\"/>\n<rect x=\"33\" y=\"68\" width=\"52\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#9fb3c6\"/><rect x=\"33\" y=\"84\" width=\"38\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#9fb3c6\"/><rect x=\"33\" y=\"100\" width=\"52\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#9fb3c6\"/><rect x=\"33\" y=\"116\" width=\"38\" height=\"7\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#9fb3c6\"/>\n<rect x=\"31\" y=\"136\" width=\"56\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"59\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Export</text>\n<path d=\"M108 116 H140\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M150.0 116.0 L139.0 110.0 L139.0 122.0z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<path d=\"M160 62 H204 L222 80 V170 H160z\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M204 62 V80 H222\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<path d=\"M170 98 H212\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M170 114 H212\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M170 130 H212\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M170 146 H212\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M232 116 H262\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M272.0 116.0 L261.0 110.0 L261.0 122.0z\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/>\n<rect x=\"282\" y=\"70\" width=\"100\" height=\"92\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><rect x=\"282\" y=\"70\" width=\"100\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#cfe0c8\"/>\n<path d=\"M307 70 V162\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M332 70 V162\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M357 70 V162\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M282 105 H382\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M282 124 H382\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M282 143 H382\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<text x=\"59\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Phone</text><text x=\"191\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">.csv file</text><text x=\"332\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Spreadsheet</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lives only on your phone.</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c0392b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lost phone = lost seasons.</text>\n<rect x=\"8\" y=\"270\" width=\"384\" height=\"57\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"293.6\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Export after each trip.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"314.6\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Save it off the phone.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Seven fields, every trip, even blank days. Five minutes in the truck (Tip).</li><li>CSV (comma separated values) export is your backup <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how the app journal works</summary><ul><li>The app journal has seven fields. Fill every one, after every trip, even the blank days.</li><li>It takes five minutes in the truck before you drive home (Tip).</li><li>Your journal lives only on your phone, in local storage. Use <strong>Export CSV</strong> after each trip as a backup (95%, how this app is built).</li><li>CSV (comma separated values) opens in any spreadsheet app.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 478\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The seven journal fields: date, one entry per day; place or MU, Management Unit, with your own pin name; species hunted, what you held a licence for; weather and wind, written as where the wind comes FROM, morning and evening; what you saw, with species, sex, number and time; shots and result, where no shots is an answer; and one lesson, one, not five.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"478\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Seven fields, every trip</text>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"44\" width=\"186\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(38 74) scale(0.8)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-14\" width=\"36\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-14\" width=\"36\" height=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M-10 -18 v6 M10 -18 v6\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-10 2 h4 M-2 2 h4 M6 2 h4 M-10 10 h4 M-2 10 h4\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g><text x=\"64\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">Date</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">One entry per</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"111\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">day</text>\n<rect x=\"204\" y=\"44\" width=\"186\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(232 74) scale(0.8)\"><path d=\"M0 20 C-14 2 -14 -18 0 -18 C14 -18 14 2 0 20 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><circle cy=\"-6\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\"/></g><text x=\"258\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">Place or MU</text><text x=\"258\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">MU plus your pin</text><text x=\"258\" y=\"111\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">name</text>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"164\" width=\"186\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(38 194) scale(0.8)\"><g transform=\"translate(2 18) scale(0.46)\"><path d=\"M-15.0 -25.0 L-13.0 -9.9 L-12.5 -1.0 L-9.5 -1.0 L-9.0 -9.9 L-9.0 -25.0z\" fill=\"#5a3e26\"/><path d=\"M-13.1 -3 L-9.1 -3 L-8.9 0 L-14.1 0z\" fill=\"#1b1b1b\"/><path d=\"M12.0 -28.0 L18.0 -9.2 L14.5 -1.0 L17.5 -1.0 L22.0 -9.2 L20.0 -28.0z\" fill=\"#5a3e26\"/><path d=\"M13.9 -3 L17.9 -3 L18.1 0 L12.9 0z\" fill=\"#1b1b1b\"/><path d=\"M22.0 -33 C27.0 -31 28.0 -27 26.0 -23 C24.0 -25 22.0 -29 21.0 -31z\" fill=\"#f2ede2\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\".8\"/><path d=\"M25.5 -27 L26.0 -23\" stroke=\"#1b1b1b\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M-20.5 -25.0 L-18.1 -9.9 L-17.6 -1.0 L-14.4 -1.0 L-13.9 -9.9 L-13.5 -25.0z\" fill=\"#7d634a\"/><path d=\"M-18.2 -3 L-14.0 -3 L-13.8 0 L-19.2 0z\" fill=\"#1b1b1b\"/><path d=\"M7.5 -28.0 L13.9 -9.2 L10.4 -1.0 L13.6 -1.0 L18.1 -9.2 L16.5 -28.0z\" fill=\"#7d634a\"/><path d=\"M9.8 -3 L14.0 -3 L14.2 0 L8.8 0z\" fill=\"#1b1b1b\"/><path d=\"M-20.0 -22.0 C-27.0 -24.0 -27.0 -34.0 -16.0 -37.0 C-6.0 -34.9 6.0 -34.5 17.0 -37.0 C28.0 -36.0 27.0 -28.0 20.0 -26.0 C7.2 -24.0 -12.0 -19.0 -20.0 -22.0z\" fill=\"#9a8166\" stroke=\"#23261f\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M18.0 -34 C24.0 -34 25.0 -28 21.0 -24 C17.0 -28 16.0 -28 18.0 -34z\" fill=\"