h d=\"M-20 -8 H8 Q16 -8 16 -14 Q16 -20 9 -19 M-20 2 H14 Q22 2 22 9 Q22 16 14 15 M-20 12 H0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"258\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">Weather and</text><text x=\"258\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">wind</text><text x=\"258\" y=\"232\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">Wind FROM,</text><text x=\"258\" y=\"251\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">morning and</text><text x=\"258\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">evening</text>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"284\" width=\"186\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(38 314) scale(0.8)\"><rect x=\"-18\" y=\"-10\" width=\"14\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"4\" y=\"-10\" width=\"14\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><rect x=\"-6\" y=\"-4\" width=\"12\" height=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><circle cx=\"-11\" cy=\"10\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dbe7f2\"/><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"10\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#dbe7f2\"/></g><text x=\"64\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">What you saw</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"332\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">Species, sex,</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"351\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">number, time</text>\n<rect x=\"204\" y=\"284\" width=\"186\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(232 314) scale(0.8)\"><circle r=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M0 -20 V-6 M0 6 V20 M-20 0 H-6 M6 0 H20\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></g><text x=\"258\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">Shots and</text><text x=\"258\" y=\"332\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">result</text><text x=\"258\" y=\"352\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">&quot;No shots&quot; is an</text><text x=\"258\" y=\"371\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">answer</text>\n<rect x=\"10\" y=\"404\" width=\"380\" height=\"64\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><g transform=\"translate(38 434) scale(0.8)\"><path d=\"M0 -18 L5 -6 L18 -6 L8 2 L12 15 L0 7 L-12 15 L-8 2 L-18 -6 L-5 -6 Z\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/></g><text x=\"64\" y=\"432\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\">One lesson</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"452\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#23261f\">One. Not five</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Place: MU (Management Unit) plus your own pin name. No landowner names (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: what to write in each field</summary><div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>What to write (Tip)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Date</td><td>Pick it. One entry per day, not per trip</td></tr><tr><td>Place or MU</td><td>MU (Management Unit) plus your own pin name: \"3-27, bench A1\". No private landowner names</td></tr><tr><td>Species hunted</td><td>What you held a licence for and were looking for</td></tr><tr><td>Weather and wind</td><td>Temperature, sky, wind direction morning and evening, snow line, moon if you track it</td></tr><tr><td>What you saw</td><td>Every animal: species, sex, number, time, where, what it was doing</td></tr><tr><td>Shots and result</td><td>Shots fired, distance, hit or miss, recovered or not. \"No shots\" is an answer</td></tr><tr><td>One lesson</td><td>One thing to repeat or one thing to fix. One, not five</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 308\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Vague versus useful journal entries. Saw some deer early, versus 7:40 am, 3 does feeding, south bench. Windy, versus west wind, from the west. About 200 yards, versus 210 m by rangefinder. Nothing today, versus no deer and 1 truck at the gate.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"308\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Write it so next year can use it</text><text x=\"105\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Vague</text><text x=\"298\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#55663f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Useful</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"64\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdf0e6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"90\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M19 85 l10 10 M29 85 l-10 10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">saw some deer early</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"64\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"90\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M212 90 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"232\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">7:40 am, 3 does</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"103\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">feeding, south bench</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"124\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdf0e6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"150\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M19 145 l10 10 M29 145 l-10 10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">windy</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"124\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"150\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M212 150 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"232\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">west wind (from the</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"163\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">west)</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"184\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdf0e6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"210\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M19 205 l10 10 M29 205 l-10 10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">about 200 yards</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"184\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"210\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M212 210 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"232\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">210 m, rangefinder</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"244\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdf0e6\" stroke=\"#e8590c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"270\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><path d=\"M19 265 l10 10 M29 265 l-10 10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">nothing today</text><rect x=\"204\" y=\"244\" width=\"186\" height=\"52\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f3f6ec\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"270\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><path d=\"M212 270 l4 5 l8 -10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"232\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">no deer, 1 truck at</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"283\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">the gate</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><figure class=\"diagram anim\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 312\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Animation: a compass with arrows of wind flowing from the west side toward the east. A west wind blows from the west. Write the wind as where it comes from.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"312\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">&quot;West wind&quot; blows FROM the west</text><circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"170\" r=\"90\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">N</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">S</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">W</text><text x=\"308\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">E</text><g><path d=\"M0 0 h50 m-10 -7 l10 7 l-10 7\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"110 130;240 130\" dur=\"2.4s\" begin=\"0.0s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></g><g><path d=\"M0 0 h50 m-10 -7 l10 7 l-10 7\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"110 170;240 170\" dur=\"2.4s\" begin=\"0.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></g><g><path d=\"M0 0 h50 m-10 -7 l10 7 l-10 7\" stroke=\"#4a7fb0\" stroke-width=\"4\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"110 210;240 210\" dur=\"2.4s\" begin=\"1.0s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></g><text x=\"200\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Write where it comes from.</text>\n</svg>\n<figcaption>A west wind blows from the west. <button class=\"anim-replay\">↻ Replay</button></figcaption></figure><ul><li>Times beat feelings. Blank days are data (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the full list</summary><ul><li>Times beat feelings. \"7:40 am, 3 does feeding, south bench\" beats \"saw some deer early\" (Tip).</li><li>Write the wind as where it came <strong>from</strong>: \"west wind\" blows from the west (90%, standard weather usage).</li><li>Write the distance you measured, not the distance you guessed (Tip). A rangefinder number or a map measure.</li><li>Log people too: other hunters, trucks at the gate, shots heard. That is hunting pressure (Tip).</li><li>Blank days are data. Where deer are not is half the map (Tip).</li><li>Keep your licences and records until the meat is eaten. The law needs the documents, and the journal tells you where they are (99%, synopsis page 7).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 326\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Timeline of journal reviews. After every trip: read the last entry before planning the next. End of November: deer seen per hour for each spot. January: pick the three best and three dead spots, and answer the Hunter Sample Questionnaire. By 31 March: the Mandatory Hunter Report if you bought an elk, moose or caribou licence. August: turn last year&#x27;s lessons into checklist items.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"326\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Read it back through the year</text><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"120\" y2=\"300\" stroke=\"#8a9a6b\" stroke-width=\"4\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"64\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#55663f\" text-anchor=\"end\">After a trip</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Read the last entry first</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"110\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#55663f\" text-anchor=\"end\">End of Nov</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Deer seen per hour, per spot</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"156\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"161\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#55663f\" text-anchor=\"end\">January</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"161\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Best 3 and dead 3 spots</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"202\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"207\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2f3a2b\" text-anchor=\"end\">January</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"207\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Questionnaire comes</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"248\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#e8590c\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#e8590c\" text-anchor=\"end\">By 31 Mar</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"253\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Hunter Report: elk, moose,</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"269\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">caribou</text><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"294\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#8a9a6b\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"299\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#55663f\" text-anchor=\"end\">August</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"299\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">Last year&#x27;s lessons become</text><text x=\"136\" y=\"315\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"start\">checklists</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Mandatory Hunter Report: elk, moose or caribou licence buyers, by 31 March <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the six reviews in full</summary><ol><li><strong>After every trip:</strong> read the last entry before you plan the next one (Tip).</li><li><strong>End of November:</strong> list every spot and count deer seen per hour hunted (Tip).</li><li><strong>January:</strong> read the whole season with your brother. Pick the three best spots and the three dead ones (Tip).</li><li><strong>January also:</strong> the Hunter Sample Questionnaire is mailed to many licence holders. Your journal makes it easy to answer (99%, synopsis page 16).</li><li><strong>By 31 March:</strong> anyone who bought an elk, moose or caribou species licence must file the <button class=\"term\" data-term=\"Mandatory Hunter Report\">Mandatory Hunter Report</button> (99%, synopsis page 16). Your journal has the days and areas.</li><li><strong>August:</strong> read last year's lessons before you scout. Turn each one into a checklist item (Tip).</li></ol></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 682\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A journal page, example only, not a real hunt. Date: a mid October Saturday. Place: MU 3-27, bench A1, glassed from knob A1G. Species: mule deer. Weather and wind: 2 C at 6:30 am, clear, light wind from the north, swung to the south by 9 am. What you saw: 6:58 am, 2 does and a fawn feeding on the bench edge. 7:25 am, they walked into timber. No bucks. One truck at the gate. Shots and result: no shots. One lesson: the wind swung by 9. Leave the knob by 8:45 next time or use spot B.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"682\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"388\" height=\"670\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fffef6\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"104\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"152\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"176\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"224\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"224\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"272\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"296\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"296\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"320\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"344\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"344\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"368\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"368\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"392\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"392\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"416\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"416\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"440\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"440\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"464\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"464\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"488\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"488\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"512\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"512\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"536\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"536\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"560\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"560\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"584\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"584\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"608\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"608\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"632\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"632\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"656\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"656\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"26\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"26\" y2=\"668\" stroke=\"#e3a7a0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Example 1: a blank morning</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Example only, not a real hunt</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">Date</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">a mid October Saturday</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">Place</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">MU 3-27, bench A1, glassed from knob A1G</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">Species</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">mule deer</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"314\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">Weather and wind</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"338\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">2 C at 6:30 am, clear, light wind from the</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">north, swung to the south by 9 am</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">What you saw</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"434\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">6:58 am, 2 does and a fawn feeding on the</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"458\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">bench edge. 7:25 am, they walked into</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"482\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">timber. No bucks. One truck at the gate.</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"530\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">Shots and result</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"554\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">no shots</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"602\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">One lesson</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"626\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">the wind swung by 9. Leave the knob by</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">8:45 next time or use spot B.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>No deer worth a shot, and still a lesson worth writing (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the example as text</summary><aside class=\"callout tip\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Tip (opinion)</div><p><strong>Example only, not a real hunt.</strong></p><ul><li>Date: a mid October Saturday</li><li>Place: MU 3-27, bench A1, glassed from knob A1G</li><li>Species: mule deer</li><li>Weather and wind: 2 C at 6:30 am, clear, light wind from the north, swung to the south by 9 am</li><li>What you saw: 6:58 am, 2 does and a fawn feeding on the bench edge. 7:25 am, they walked into timber. No bucks. One truck at the gate.</li><li>Shots and result: no shots</li><li>One lesson: the wind swung by 9. Leave the knob by 8:45 next time or use spot B.</li></ul></aside></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 706\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A journal page, example only, not a real hunt. Date: an early November weekday. Place: MU 3-27, cutblock edge B2. Species: white tailed deer. Weather and wind: minus 4 C, 3 cm fresh snow, wind from the west all day. What you saw: 4:10 pm, 1 buck at the timber edge, walking, never stopped. Shots and result: 1 shot, ranged 210 m (230 yd), off hand, clean miss. Checked for hair and blood 30 minutes: none. One lesson: no rest, moving deer. Practise sitting and kneeling shots, and wait for a stop or pass.\">\n<rect width=\"400\" height=\"706\" fill=\"#fffaf0\"/>\n<rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"388\" height=\"694\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#fffef6\" stroke=\"#2f3a2b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"104\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"128\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"128\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"152\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"176\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"224\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"224\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"272\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"272\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"296\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"296\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"320\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"344\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"344\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"368\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"368\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"392\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"392\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"416\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"416\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"440\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"440\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"464\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"464\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"488\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"488\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"512\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"512\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"536\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"536\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"560\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"560\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"584\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"584\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"608\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"608\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"632\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"632\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"656\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"656\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"10\" y1=\"680\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"680\" stroke=\"#cfe0ee\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n<line x1=\"26\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"26\" y2=\"692\" stroke=\"#e3a7a0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#23261f\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Example 2: a miss</text>\n<text x=\"200\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Example only, not a real hunt</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">Date</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">an early November weekday</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">Place</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">MU 3-27, cutblock edge B2</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">Species</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">white tailed deer</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"314\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">Weather and wind</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"338\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">minus 4 C, 3 cm fresh snow, wind from the</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">west all day</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"410\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">What you saw</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"434\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">4:10 pm, 1 buck at the timber edge, walking,</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"458\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">never stopped</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"506\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">Shots and result</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"530\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">1 shot, ranged 210 m (230 yd), off hand,</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"554\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">clean miss. Checked for hair and blood 30</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"578\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">minutes: none</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"626\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#c2410c\">One lesson</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">no rest, moving deer. Practise sitting and</text>\n<text x=\"36\" y=\"674\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#1d3557\" font-style=\"italic\">kneeling shots, and wait for a stop or pass.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>A miss written down is practice planned (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the example as text</summary><aside class=\"callout tip\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Tip (opinion)</div><p><strong>Example only, not a real hunt.</strong></p><ul><li>Date: an early November weekday</li><li>Place: MU 3-27, cutblock edge B2</li><li>Species: white tailed deer</li><li>Weather and wind: minus 4 C, 3 cm fresh snow, wind from the west all day</li><li>What you saw: 4:10 pm, 1 buck at the timber edge, walking, never stopped</li><li>Shots and result: 1 shot, ranged 210 m (230 yd), off hand, clean miss. Checked for hair and blood 30 minutes: none</li><li>One lesson: no rest, moving deer. Practise sitting and kneeling shots, and wait for a stop or pass.</li></ul></aside></details>","<aside class=\"callout rule\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): Write it down tonight. Tomorrow you will remember a bigger buck and a shorter walk.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Logging only the days you saw something. The blank days show you where not to go.</li><li>Writing \"windy\" instead of a direction. You cannot plan the next trip from \"windy\".</li><li>Never exporting. A lost phone takes three seasons of notes with it.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Tonight, enter your last trip in the app, all seven fields. Then tap Export CSV and save the file somewhere off the phone.</p></aside>","<ul><li>Hunt Mentor app, journal screen: field list and Export CSV button, read from the app code, checked 2026-10-02 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li><a href=\"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/assets/gov/sports-recreation-arts-and-culture/outdoor-recreation/fishing-and-hunting/hunting/regulations/hunting-trapping-synopsis.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BC Hunting and Trapping Regulations Synopsis 2026 to 2028</a>, read directly, checked 2026-10-02: page 7 (keeping licences and records), page 16 (Hunter Sample Questionnaire, Mandatory Hunter Report). 99%.</li><li>Wind direction convention: standard weather usage <span class=\"cert c-mid\" title=\"Certainty\">90%</span>.</li><li>Everything else: journal habits, labelled Tip. The two entries are made up examples.</li></ul>"]